    {
      "id": "menu/Compdata/07/0024",
      "source_text_sha256": "a84008ba623b8ca4bcd3b056d2a8912240c62884baecb43cd47848818a5edb63",
      "translation": "合神後經過3回合，格蘭維昂將達到\n重力子臨界，屆時會自動解除合神。\n此後在同一地圖中無法再次合神。\n要進行合神嗎？",
      "editorial_status": "draft",
      "glossary_refs": [
        "system/combine",
        "technology/graviton-critical",
        "unit/god-gravion"
      ],
      "notes": "机体名按全局术语 unit/god-gravion 统一为“格兰维昂”。",
      "zh_hans_sha256": "72c915f69c366a24f80fe3d9ac31477c8323e836aa7138a515500810a19be9ee",
      "zh_hant_status": "draft"
